# sandbox-egress destination allowlist (extended regex, one per line).
#
# Every request from a sandboxed container is filtered against this list.
# If none of these patterns match the destination hostname, tinyproxy
# returns 403 and no bytes leave sandbox_net.
#
# Update by adding a new anchored regex line. Anchor with ^ and $ or a
# trailing dot-domain match so a typosquat like `pypi.org.attacker.com`
# is not accepted.
#
# Do NOT list the wildcard `.*` here — that would defeat the entire
# egress model. If a sandbox needs a domain not on this list, the correct
# fix is to add the specific domain, not to widen the allowlist.

# Python — package index and file host.
^pypi\.org$
^files\.pythonhosted\.org$
^pythonhosted\.org$

# Node — official registry (npmjs) and the widely-used esm.sh CDN for
# browser-ESM React imports (used by static/single-file React demos).
^registry\.npmjs\.org$
^esm\.sh$

# General web CDN commonly needed for React / Vite templates — jsdelivr.
^cdn\.jsdelivr\.net$
